OL,3,GNEWSARogue builder jailed over #377,000
OL,4,Afraud
OL,5,
OL,6,FA builder who defrauded 10 victims out
OL,7,Fof more than #377,000 in a "sustained
OL,8,Fand deliberate" effort has been jailed.
OL,10,FColin Ridley, 72, accepted large sums
OL,11,Fof money for building projects between
OL,12,F2019 and 2023 that were "poorly
OL,13,Fcompleted, significantly delayed or
OL,14,Fnever finished", Leicestershire County
OL,15,FCouncil said.
OL,17,FSeveral homeowners were forced to spend
OL,18,Fthousands of pounds correcting
OL,19,Fdefective work, while two properties
OL,20,Frequired "major demolition and complete
OL,21,Freconstruction", the authority added.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
